---
context: labels
type: label_lattice
---

# Labels
# Workspace-level lattice per R1 §1.2. Declares the label hierarchy used by
# the `LabelArbiter` and the narrator filter. `dominates:` makes a label
# imply another at egress (e.g. anything @phi is also @pii). `default_egress:`
# sets what the arbiter does when a labeled value attempts to cross a channel
# whose audience does not include that label.
- phi:           { dominates: [pii],     default_egress: deny }
- pii:           {                        default_egress: deny }
- secret:        { params: [audience],   default_egress: deny }
- npc_internal:  {                        default_egress: deny }
- verified:      {                        default_egress: allow }
- user_content:  {                        default_egress: redact_and_warn }
- potential_malicious: {                  default_egress: deny }
